	(text "SPEC.md 5, 9.2 - DECISIONS.md D016 / D017 / D018"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "879c010a-962e-491a-92f7-29c533929699")
	)

	(text "Six isolated SiC gate-drive channels - Infineon 1ED3491MC12M (D017) driving FS02MR12A8MA2B (D016). Datasheet refs = 1ED34x1Mc12M ds v1.20.\nSupplies: +18 V (VGD_*_P) / -5 V (VGD_*_N) per D017, VGD_*_COM = Kelvin-source reference (= KSRC_*). HS channels: individual isolated supplies.\n   LS channels share VGD_LS_* (Kelvin sources at common DC- potential; KSRC_LS_1/2/3 tie together on the shared COM by construction).\n   Rails come from aux_power (future work) - VGD_* sheet pins left unwired at root; one PWR_FLAG per rail net.\nTurn-on RC delay per input (D018 backstop): 1k + 330p, BAS316 bypasses the R on turn-OFF (delay acts on turn-ON only). [TBV] ~250 ns per D018;\n   note ds 4.3: VIH = 0.7 VCC1, so RC = 330 ns computes to ~400 ns to threshold - characterise and retune. Min IN pulse width 103 ns (ds 4.3.1).\nFLT_N: open-drain fault outputs wired-AND across all six -> DRV_FAULT_IN -> supervisor (4.7k pull-up here, in parallel with supervisor R909 10k -> ~3.2k effective; ds typ 2.2k).\nRDYC (ds 3.2, 4.3.2): combined ready output (OD, act-high) + fault-clear/fault-off input (act-low); ds buses all drivers on one wire.\n   RDYC_BUS: 4.7k pull-up, driven from supervisor DRV_RST_OUT via 1k series R (ALVC08 is push-pull; R limits contention while a not-ready\n   driver holds RDYC low; driven-low level 0.58 V < VIL 0.99 V). Fault clear = RDYC low > 1 us with IN low (ds 4.1).\nMiller clamp (ds 4.5.4.1 Fig. 19): CLAMPDRV -> external SOT-23 NMOS, drain = gate node, source = VEE2 (datasheet clamps to VEE2, not COM).\nDESAT (ds 4.4): 1k [TBV] + 2x US1M 1000 V (2 kV standoff for 1200 V node) -> DSENSE_* (module drain-sense); 100p [TBV] blanking cap to COM.\n   ADJB 1.33k -> t_leb 650 ns + t_filter 1575 ns (ds Table 4) [TBV]. ADJA 4.87k -> soft-off 349 mA, mid-range (ds Table 7) [TBV].\nGate resistors: R_on 12R / R_off 3R3 [TBV] - datasheet switching condition, SPEC 5 (module R_G,int 0.66R, Q_G 1.19 uC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 248 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "df0e4530-5758-4bb3-9ce3-7af240accf3b")
	)

